; Procedural RULELIST template (SFam / shared named lists).
; Lines that start with ';' are instructions — delete them before committing.
; Keep '//' comments (license and section headers).

; File naming: Rules_<phase>_<system>.rule  (example: Rules_Default_HVAC.rule)
; Soft line length: 80 characters.
; Flags after the list name are 0 or 1:
;   1  evaluate regardless of datatype (1) vs skip Library/User values (0)
;   2  iteration flag — ignored in the residential ruleset
;   3  classify writes as user-defined (1) vs ruleset-defined (0)
;   4  bypass SetBDData resets (1) vs allow resets (0)
// TO DO:
// ISSUE:

